+
+Also assert yesterday/today/tomorrow/no date/done inclusion, omitted PATCH preservation, resetting done, ordered filtered results, empty filter, detached responses and ignored client overdue. Reject `''`, whitespace, non-padded dates, timestamps, numbers, booleans, arrays, objects, `2026-02-30`, `2026-04-31`, `1900-02-29`; accept `2000-02-29` and `2028-02-29`. Test failed combined PATCH preserves every field. Use years `0001` and `0099` to catch Date.UTC's 0–99 mapping.
